# Prisma records a sha256 of each migration.sql in _prisma_migrations.checksum.
# With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout rewrites these files to CRLF, which
# changes that hash, and Prisma then reports applied migrations as "modified
# after they were applied" (and refuses migrate deploy / migrate dev).
# Pinning LF keeps the checksum identical on Windows, Linux and CI.
prisma/migrations/**/migration.sql text eol=lf
